  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "All staff must complete genAI training before use; every tool must be approved by ICT/Technology Assurance and the Security and Privacy Reference Group.",
   "Fully automated genAI use without a human in the loop is prohibited; users remain accountable.",
   "genAI outputs must be labelled; AI transcripts/translations marked DRAFT and not used directly as evidence.",
   "genAI outputs in court contexts not permitted without prior court approval.",
   "Vendor genAI use must be notified and agreed; audit logs and six-monthly audits and policy reviews required."
